#: cleanup-config-page.ui:45
msgid "Move the current cleanup action to the top of the list."
msgstr "将当前的清理动作移至列表顶部。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:59
msgid "Move the current cleanup action one position up in the list."
msgstr "将当前的清理动作在列表中上移一个位置。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:86
msgid ""
"Create a new cleanup action.\n"
"You can create as many as you like."
msgstr ""
"创建新的清理动作。\n"
"可依需要创建任意数量的清理动作。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:101
msgid "Remove the current cleanup action."
msgstr "移除当前的清理动作。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:128
msgid "Move the current cleanup action one position down in the list."
msgstr "将当前的清理动作在列表中下移一个位置。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:142
msgid "Move the current cleanup action to the bottom of the list."
msgstr "将当前的清理动作移至列表底部。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:165
msgid "Uncheck to disable this cleanup action completely."
msgstr "取消勾选可完全禁用此清理动作。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:168
msgid "&Active"
msgstr "激活(&A)"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:185
msgid "&Title:"
msgstr "标题(&T)："

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:201
msgid ""
"Check this if a confirmation dialog should be\n"
"opened before executing the command.\n"
"There will be only one confirmation dialog,\n"
"even if multiple items are selected or if\n"
"the command is executed recursively."
msgstr ""
"勾选此选项，可在运行命令前\n"
"打开确认对话框。\n"
"即使选择多个项目，\n"
"或以递归方式运行命令，\n"
"也只会显示一次确认对话框。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:208
msgid "As&k For Confirmation"
msgstr "运行前确认(&K)"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:221
msgid ""
"Enter a title for this cleanup action.\n"
"This will show up in the menus.\n"
"You can add a hotkey with \"&\"."
msgstr ""
"输入此清理动作的标题。\n"
"此标题会显示在菜单中。\n"
"可使用“&”设置快捷键。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:248
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"These are the macros you can use in the command.\n"
"Both %p and %n always contain only one item.\n"
"If multiple items are selected, the command will be\n"
"executed multiple times."
msgstr ""
"这些是可在命令中使用的宏。\n"
"%p 和 %n 一律只包含一个项目。\n"
"若选择多个项目，\n"
"命令就会运行多次。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:254
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"%p  Full Path\n"
"%n  File / Directory Name Without Path\n"
"%d  Directory Name With Full Path\n"
msgstr ""
"%p  完整路径\n"
"%n  文件或目录名称（不含路径）\n"
"%d  目录名称（含完整路径）\n"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:288
msgid "&Command Line:"
msgstr "命令行(&C)："

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:298
msgid ""
"Enter the command to be executed here.\n"
"Each command will be executed with a shell.\n"
"\n"
"If multiple items are selected, the command\n"
"will be executed once for each selected item."
msgstr ""
"在此输入要运行的命令。\n"
"每个命令都会通过shell运行。\n"
"\n"
"若选择多个项目，\n"
"命令会针对每个选择项目各运行一次。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:315
msgid ""
"Select if the command should be executed recursively\n"
"for each directory in the selected branch.\n"
"The command will be called separately for each directory level."
msgstr ""
"选择是否针对所选分支中的每个目录\n"
"以递归方式运行命令。\n"
"每一层目录都会分别运行此命令。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:320
msgid "&Recurse Into Subdirectories"
msgstr "递归处理子目录(&R)"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:333
msgid ""
"This specifies if and how the directory tree should be\n"
"re-read from disk after the cleanup action is finished."
msgstr ""
"指定清理动作完成后，是否重新从磁盘\n"
"读取目录树，以及重新读取的方式。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:341
msgid "No Refresh"
msgstr "不刷新"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:346
msgid "Refresh This Item"
msgstr "刷新此项目"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:351
msgid "Refresh This Item's Parent"
msgstr "刷新此项目的上层目录"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:356
msgid "Assume Item Has Been Deleted"
msgstr "视为已删除此项目"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:370
msgid "R&efresh Policy:"
msgstr "刷新方式(&E)："

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:416
msgid "Works For..."
msgstr "适用项目…"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:424
msgid "Check this if the command can be applied to directories."
msgstr "若命令可用于目录，请勾选此选项。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:427
msgid "&Directories"
msgstr "目录(&D)"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:434
msgid "Check this if the command can be applied to files."
msgstr "若命令可用于文件，请勾选此选项。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:437
msgid "&Files"
msgstr "文件(&F)"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:444
msgid ""
"Check this if the command can be applied to the <Files> entries in the "
"tree.\n"
"Note that they don't really have a counterpart on the disk."
msgstr ""
"若命令可用于目录树中的<文件>项目，请勾选此选项。\n"
"请注意，磁盘上并没有与这些项目对应的实际目录。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:448
msgid "<Files> Pse&udo Entries"
msgstr "<文件>虚拟项目(&U)"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:479
msgid "Output Window"
msgstr "输出窗口"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:493
msgid "&Policy:"
msgstr "显示方式(&P)："

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:509
msgid ""
"Select if and when to open a window for the output of the command.\n"
"If there is an error, the output window is always opened unless\n"
"\"Never Show\" is selected here.\n"
"\"Show After Timeout\" is a useful setting for most cases."
msgstr ""
"选择是否打开命令输出窗口，以及打开的时机。\n"
"除非在此选择“永不显示”，否则发生错误时\n"
"一律会打开输出窗口。\n"
"大多数情况下，建议使用“逾时后显示”。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:519
msgid "Show Always"
msgstr "一律显示"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:524
msgid "Show If Error Output"
msgstr "有错误输出时显示"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:529
msgid "Show After Timeout"
msgstr "逾时后显示"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:534
msgid "Never Show"
msgstr "永不显示"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:548
msgid "Ti&meout:"
msgstr "逾时时间(&M)："

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:564
msgid ""
"Set the timeout for the \"Show After Timeout\" setting.\n"
"Don't underestimate your computer: It can get more\n"
"done in half a second than you might think.\n"
"On the other hand, waiting for half a second feels\n"
"longer than you might think."
msgstr ""
"设置“逾时后显示”的等待时间。\n"
"别低估电脑的速度：它在半秒内\n"
"能完成的工作可能比您想像的更多。\n"
"但另一方面，等待半秒的感受\n"
"也可能比您想像的更久。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:571 general-config-page.ui:191
msgid " sec"
msgstr " 秒"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:587
msgid ""
"Check this to automatically close the\n"
"output window if there was no error.\n"
"If you are interested in the output of your\n"
"command, uncheck this."
msgstr ""
"勾选此选项，可在未发生错误时\n"
"自动关闭输出窗口。\n"
"若需要查看命令的输出内容，\n"
"请取消勾选。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:593
msgid "Auto C&lose If No Error"
msgstr "无错误时自动关闭(&L)"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:630
msgid "Shell"
msgstr "Shell"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:644
msgid "&Shell:"
msgstr "Shell(&S)："

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:660
msgid ""
"Select a shell here or enter your favourite one.\n"
"\n"
"Each command is executed with a shell and the \"-c\" option.\n"
"Shells may behave differently for wildcards and special characters.\n"
"\n"
"If you are setting this up for other users, better stay on the safe side\n"
"and select a shell with a well-known behaviour like /bin/bash."
msgstr ""
"在此选择shell，或输入您常用的shell。\n"
"\n"
"每个命令都会通过shell配合“-c”选项运行。\n"
"不同shell处理通配符与特殊字符的方式可能不同。\n"
"\n"
"若您正在替其他用户设置，建议选择行为明确的shell，\n"
"例如 /bin/bash，以减少兼容性问题。"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:673
msgid "$SHELL (Login Shell)"
msgstr "$SHELL（登录 Shell）"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:678
msgid "/bin/bash"
msgstr "/bin/bash"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:683
msgid "/bin/sh"
msgstr "/bin/sh"

#: cleanup-config-page.ui:693
msgid ""
"Each command is executed with a shell\n"
"and the '-c' option."
msgstr ""
"每个命令都会通过shell\n"
"配合“-c”选项运行。"

